@221 = ~Explosion~
@222 = ~Explosion (Evocation)
Level: 2
Sphere: elemental (fire)
Range: 0
Duration: instantaneous
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: radius 5 meters
Saving Throw: half

The spell unleashes an explosion centered on the caster, damaging all creatures within a 5-meter radius. All affected creatures suffer 1d4 points of fire damage per caster level (up to a maximum of 10d4). A save vs. breath weapon halves the damage.~
@2221 = ~Explosion (Evocation)
Level: 2
Sphere: elemental (fire)
Range: 0
Duration: instantaneous
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: radius 5 meters
Saving Throw: half

The spell unleashes an explosion centered on the caster, damaging all creatures within a 5-meter radius around him. All affected creatures suffer 12d4 points of fire damage (13d4 at level 30 and 14d4 at level 40). A save vs. breath weapon halves the damage.~
@2222 = ~Explosion (Evocation)
Level: 2
Sphere: elemental (fire)
Range: 0
Duration: instantaneous
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: radius 5 meters
Saving Throw: half

The spell unleashes an explosion centered on the caster, damaging all creatures within a 5-meter radius around him. All affected creatures suffer 10d4 points of fire damage. A save vs. breath weapon at a -2 penalty (an additional -1 for every 5 levels of the spellcaster beyond level 20) halves the damage.~

@224 = ~Flame Blade (Evocation)
Level: 2
Sphere: elemental (fire)
Range: 0
Duration: 4 rounds + 1 round / 2 levels
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: special
Saving Throw: none

The caster creates a blade of searing fire in his hand. It is wielded like a sword, without any penalty for lack of proficiency. If the caster successfully hits with the flame blade, the creature struck suffers 1d8 points of fire damage, +1 every 2 levels of the caster of the spell (up to a maximum 1d8 +10). The blade is immaterial and gains no damage bonus from the wielder's Strength. It cannot harm creatures immune to fire or creatures that can only be hit by magical weapons.
Flame Blade cannot be enchanted by the spell "Blazing Weapon".~
@2241 = ~Flame Blade (Evocation)
Level: 2
Sphere: elemental (fire)
Range: 0
Duration: 14 rounds
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: special
Saving Throw: none

The caster creates a blade of searing fire in his hand. It is wielded like a sword, without any penalty for lack of proficiency. If the caster successfully hits with the flame blade, the creature struck suffers 1d8 +12 points of fire damage (1d8 +13 at level 30 and 1d8 +14 at level 40). The blade is immaterial and gains no damage bonus from the wielder's Strength. It cannot harm creatures immune to fire or creatures that can only be hit by magical weapons.
Flame Blade cannot be enchanted by the spell "Blazing Weapon".~

@225 = ~Lower Fire Resistance~
@226 = ~Lower Fire Resistance (Abjuration, Alteration)
Level: 2
Sphere: charm, elemental (fire)
Range: visual range of the caster
Duration: 5 rounds + 1 round / level
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: 10-meter radius
Saving Throw: negates

When the preacher of flames casts this spell, elemental energies sweep through the chosen area. All creatures within the area must make a successful save vs. spell or their fire resistance will be lowered by 2% for each level of the preacher (max 40%).~
