Damage: 2d8 (save vs. spell to halve damage)~
@228 = ~Fire Seeds (Conjuration)
Level: 2
Sphere: elemental (fire)
Range: 0
Duration: 3 turns
Casting Time: 2
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: half

This spell creates 4 fire seeds in the caster's inventory. They last for 3 turns before disappearing. A seed thrown at an enemy explodes into a fireball, dealing 2-16 points of damage to all within the area of effect, allowing a save vs. spells for half damage.~
