@229 = ~Rain of Fire~
@2210 = ~Rain of Fire (Evocation)
Level: 2
Sphere: elemental (fire)
Range: 20 meters
Duration: instantaneous
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: one creature and a 2.5-meter radius around it
Saving Throw: half

This spell showers the target with burning embers. The target and all creatures within a 2.5-meter radius suffer 1D6 points of fire damage per level of caster (maximum 10D6). For each creature, a successful save vs. spell halves the damage.~
@22101 = ~Rain of Fire (Evocation)
Level: 2
Sphere: elemental (fire)
Range: 20 meters
Duration: instantaneous
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: one creature and a 2.5-meter radius around it
Saving Throw: half

This spell showers the target with burning embers. The target and all creatures within a 2.5-meter radius suffer 12D6 points of fire damage (13D6 at level 30 and 14D6 at level 40). For each creature, a successful save vs. spell halves the damage.~
@22102 = ~Rain of Fire (Evocation)
Level: 2
Sphere: elemental (fire)
Range: 20 meters
Duration: instantaneous
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: one creature and a 2.5-meter radius around it
Saving Throw: half

This spell showers the target with burning embers. The target and all creatures within a 2.5-meter radius suffer 10D6 points of fire damage. For each creature, a successful save vs. spell at -2 (an additional -1 for every 5 levels of the caster beyond level 20) halves the damage.~

@2211 = ~Burning Blood~
@2212 = ~Burning Blood (Alteration)
Level: 2
Sphere: elemental (fire)
Range: 30 meters
Duration: 4 rounds
Casting Time: 2
Area of Effect: one creature
Saving Throw: negates

This horrific spell boils the target's blood if it fails a save at -2 (an additional -1 for every 5 caster levels beyond level 20). Creatures with no blood (undead, golems, elementals, etc.) cannot be affected by this spell.
During the first round, the victim's blood begins to heat up, leaving it weak and feverish. From the second through the fourth round, the temperature rises until its internal organs burn. The effects are as follows:
1st round: the victim suffers a -1 penalty to attack rolls until the end of the spell.
2nd round: the victim suffers 1D4 points of damage
3rd round: the victim suffers 2D4 points of damage and -1 to saving throws until the end of the spell.
4th round: the victim suffers 4D4 points of damage.~

@2213 = ~Magma Bomb~
@2214 = ~Magma Bomb (Enchantment)
Level: 2
Sphere: elemental (fire)
Range: 0
Duration: instantaneous
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

This spell transforms a stone into a mass of molten magma. The preacher can throw it as a projectile that counts as a +1 magical weapon, but grants no bonus to attack or damage rolls. If it hits a creature, it explodes and covers the victim in magma, dealing 1D4 crushing damage and 2D4 fire damage.
The magma remains hot after the impact for 1 round every 3 levels of the spellcaster for a maximum of 6 rounds at level 18 (half if the target makes a successful save vs. spell) and deals 2D4 fire damage per round. It then cools, crumbles and falls away as dust.~
@22141 = ~This huge ball of molten rock has been created by the spell Magma Bomb. It does not burn the wielder's hand and will explode if it hits a creature.~
@22142 = ~Magma Bomb (Enchantment)
Level: 2
Sphere: elemental (fire)
Range: 0
Duration: instantaneous
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

This spell transforms a stone into a mass of molten magma. The preacher can throw it as a projectile that counts as a +1 magical weapon, but grants no bonus to attack or damage rolls. If it hits a creature, it explodes and covers the victim in magma, dealing 1D4 crushing damage and 2D5 fire damage.
The magma remains hot after the impact for 6 rounds after hitting (3 rounds if the target makes a successful save vs. spell) and inflicts 2D5 additional points of fire damage per round. It then cools, crumbles and falls away as dust.
At level 30, both the initial and ongoing fire damage become 1D5 + 1D6.
At level 40, both become 2D6.~
@22143 = ~Magma Bomb (Enchantment)
Level: 2
Sphere: elemental (fire)
Range: 0
Duration: instantaneous
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

This spell transforms a stone into a mass of molten magma. The preacher can throw it as a projectile that counts as a +1 magical weapon, but grants no bonus to attack or damage rolls. If it hits a creature, it explodes and covers the victim in magma, dealing 1D4 crushing damage and 2D4 burning points of damage.
The magma remains hot 6 rounds after the impact, 3 rounds if the target makes a successful save vs. spell at -2 (an additional -1 for every 5 levels of the caster beyond level 20), and deals 2D4 fire damage per round. It then cools, crumbles and falls away as dust.~

@2216 = ~Produce Fire (Transmutation)
Level: 2
Sphere: elemental (fire)
Range: visual range of the caster
Duration: 1 round
Casting Time: 5
Area of Effect: radius 2.5 meters
Saving Throw: none

This spell creates flames that deal 1d4 points of damage plus 1 point per caster level to all creatures in the area of effect.~
@22161 = ~Produce Fire (Transmutation)
Level: 2
Sphere: elemental (fire)
Range: visual range of the caster
Duration: 1 round
Casting Time: 5
Area of Effect: radius 2.5 meters
Saving Throw: none

This spell creates flames that deal 1d5 + 24 points of damage and an additional 1 point of damage per level of the caster beyond level 20 to all creatures in the area of effect.
At caster level 30, the damage becomes 1D6 + 39, and 1D6 + 42 at level 40.~

